<% content_for :page_title, "Citation Guide - #{application_name}" %>

<div class="blacklight-pages-api_access">
  <section class="site-section api-site-section">
    <div class="container api-access-page api-access-page--modern">
      <header class="api-hero">
        <div class="api-hero__grid api-hero__grid--single">
          <div class="api-hero__copy">
            <h1 class="section-title">
              <span class="api-hero__eyebrow-text">Canadiana Collections And Infrastructure</span>
              <span class="api-hero__title-main">Citation Guide</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="api-lede">
              Please adhere to the following guidelines when citing materials from the Canadiana Collection.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="api-layout">
        <aside class="api-toc" aria-label="On this page">
          <h2 class="api-toc__title">On this page</h2>
          <a href="#citation-guidelines">Citation guidelines</a>
          <a href="#citation-send-copy">Send a copy to CRKN</a>
          <a href="#citation-examples">Citation examples</a>
          <a href="#citation-resources">Additional resources</a>
          <a href="#citation-related-docs">Related documents</a>
        </aside>

        <div class="api-content">
          <section id="citation-guidelines" class="api-card">
            <h2>Citation guidelines</h2>

            <h3>1. Cite Canadiana as the source</h3>
            <p>
              If you use or reproduce materials from the Canadiana Collection in any format, cite Canadiana as the source
              of the material. Please also include the persistent URL for the item in your citation. Persistent URLs are
              available at the bottom of each document record.
            </p>
            <p>
              In cases of discrepancies between the item and its metadata, use the information on the item itself.
              Please let us know if you find errors in the metadata and we’ll make corrections.
            </p>

            <h3>2. Send a copy of your work to CRKN</h3>
            <p>
              We also would love to hear from you regarding your use of the Canadiana collection. This can help us continue
              to develop the collection in ways that help serve your needs and interests.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="citation-send-copy" class="api-card">
            <h2>Send a copy to CRKN</h2>
            <p>
              Upon completing publicly available works (for example publications, dissertations, theses, papers,
              conference proceedings, creative works, news items, or documentaries) that make use of materials from
              the Canadiana Collection, please send a copy or a link to your work to CRKN.
            </p>
            <address class="mb-0">
              Canadian Research Knowledge Network (CRKN)<br>
              1309 Carling Ave<br>
              PO Box 35155 Westgate<br>
              Ottawa, ON K1Z 1A2<br>
              t. <a href="tel:+16139077040">613.907.7040</a><br>
              <a href="mailto:info@crkn.ca">info@crkn.ca</a>
            </address>
            <p class="mt-3 mb-0">
              Please contact CRKN if you have any questions about how to cite material from Canadiana.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="citation-examples" class="api-card">
            <h2>Citation Examples</h2>

            <h3>American Psychological Association (APA) 7th edition</h3>
            <h4>MONOGRAPHS</h4>
            <p>
              Dawson, S. E. (1882). <em>Hand-book for the city of Montreal and its environs</em>. Dawson Bros.; Canadiana.
              https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0ff3kw5bv04.
            </p>
            <h4>NEWSPAPER ARTICLES</h4>
            <p>
              One of the strikers writes director of Dominion Coal Co. telling latter the cause of the strike.
              (1909, September 28). <em>The Glace Bay Standard</em>, <em>65</em>(1), 1. Canadiana,
              https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0rr1pg1kg8f.
            </p>
            <h4>ANNUAL REPORTS</h4>
            <p>
              Ontario Society of Artists. (1894). <em>The President’s Report 1893/94</em>. Canadiana.
              https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0901zc7wv2w.
            </p>
            <h4>MAPS</h4>
            <p>
              Canada Centre for Mapping. (1990). <em>Sambro, Nova Scotia</em> [Map]. 1:50,000. Edition 5 MCE.
              Department of Energy, Mines and Resources. Canadiana, https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0xs5j96503h.
            </p>

            <h3>Chicago Style (17th edition, notes/bibliography)</h3>
            <h4>MONOGRAPHS</h4>
            <p>
              Dawson, Samuel Edward. <em>Hand-Book for the City of Montreal and Its Environs</em>. Montreal: Dawson Bros.,
              1882. Canadiana, https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0ff3kw5bv04.
            </p>
            <h4>NEWSPAPER ARTICLES</h4>
            <p>
              <em>The Glace Bay Standard</em>. “One of the Strikers Writes Director of Dominion Coal Co. Telling Latter
              the Cause of the Strike.” 65, no. 1 (September 28, 1909): 1. Canadiana,
              https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0rr1pg1kg8f.
            </p>
            <h4>ANNUAL REPORTS</h4>
            <p>
              Ontario Society of Artists. <em>The President’s Report 1893/94</em>. Toronto, 1894. Canadiana,
              https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0901zc7wv2w.
            </p>
            <h4>MAPS</h4>
            <p>
              Canada Centre for Mapping. <em>Sambro, Nova Scotia</em> [map]. Edition 5 MCE. 1:50,000. Ottawa:
              Department of Energy, Mines and Resources, 1990. Canadiana, https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0xs5j96503h.
            </p>

            <h3>Modern Language Association (MLA) 9th edition</h3>
            <h4>MONOGRAPHS</h4>
            <p>
              Dawson, Samuel Edward. <em>Hand-Book for the City of Montreal and Its Environs</em>. Dawson Bros., 1882.
              Canadiana, https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0ff3kw5bv04.
            </p>
            <h4>NEWSPAPER ARTICLES</h4>
            <p>
              “One of the Strikers Writes Director of Dominion Coal Co. Telling Latter the Cause of the Strike.”
              <em>The Glace Bay Standard</em>, no. 65, vol. 1, 28 Sept. 1909, pp. 1. Canadiana,
              https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0rr1pg1kg8f.
            </p>
            <h4>ANNUAL REPORTS</h4>
            <p>
              Ontario Society of Artists. <em>The President’s Report 1893/94</em>. 1894. Canadiana,
              https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0901zc7wv2w.
            </p>
            <h4>MAPS</h4>
            <p class="mb-0">
              Canada Centre for Mapping. <em>Sambro, Nova Scotia</em>. Map. Edition 5 MCE. 1:50,000.
              Ottawa: Department of Energy, Mines and Resources, 1990. Canadiana,
              https://n2t.net/ark:/69429/m0xs5j96503h.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="citation-resources" class="api-card">
            <h2>Additional resources</h2>
            <p>
              See the <a href="<%= terms_of_service_path(lang: I18n.locale) %>">Canadiana.ca Terms of Service</a>
              for information on copyright and rules governing the use of Canadiana materials.
            </p>
            <p>
              To cite materials from the Héritage Collection, see the
              <a href="<%= I18n.t('links.URL_CITATION_GUIDE_HERITAGE') %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Library and Archives Canada Citation Guide</a>.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0">
              We also recommend the <a href="https://hsscommons.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canadian HSS Commons</a>
              as a place to share research and connect with others. The Canadian HSS Commons supports research, education,
              and collaboration by helping members share, access, develop, re-purpose, and preserve scholarly data and resources.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="citation-related-docs" class="api-card">
            <h2 class="citation-related-docs__heading">Related Documents</h2>
            <div class="citation-related-docs__item">
              <a class="citation-related-docs__link" href="https://www.crkn-rcdr.ca/sites/default/files/2025-09/Canadiana%20Citation%20Guide%20-%20English%20print_1.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <span class="citation-related-docs__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-pdf-fill"></i>
                  <span class="citation-related-docs__icon-label">PDF</span>
                </span>
                <span class="citation-related-docs__title">Canadiana Citation Guide - English print_1.pdf</span>
              </a>
              <p class="citation-related-docs__desc mb-0">PDF copy of Canadiana Citation Guide in English</p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
